      {
        "type": "multiline_label",
        "data": {
          "name": "multiline_label_my_preparation_station_is_where",
          "text": "My Preparation Station is where cooked food becomes a meal ready for the table. I bring the food here first; this counter does not cook it for me.\nI gather what one guest ordered, check the amounts, and put their meal together. Even friends sharing a table deserve their own serving.\nOnce the meal is ready, I take it with me before preparing the next one.",
