      {
        "type": "multiline_label",
        "data": {
          "name": "multiline_label_my_preparation_station_is_where_copy",
          "text": "Everything I put on the counter goes into the same serving, including the full amount of each food. Leaving tomorrow's supplies here would make today's meal rather generous. I should set aside only what I intend to serve and keep the rest in storage. The station can put a meal together, but it cannot decide what my guest wanted. Checking the order is still my job.",
